<p>Dear submitter,</p>

<p>
  <%= pluralize(@files.size, 'file') %> you uploaded <%= @files.size == 1 ? 'is' : 'are' %> still waiting to be used in
  a submission. A file that nothing uses is removed after seven days, so
  <%= @files.size == 1 ? 'it goes' : 'the earliest of them goes' %> on <%= @until.to_date.iso8601 %>.
</p>

<ul>
  <% @files.each do |file| %>
    <li>
      <%= file.blob.filename %> (<%= number_to_human_size file.blob.byte_size %>), uploaded
      <%= file.created_at.to_date.iso8601 %>, removed on
      <%= (file.created_at + ExpireUnassignedFilesJob::KEEP_FOR).to_date.iso8601 %>
    </li>
  <% end %>
</ul>

<p>
  To keep <%= @files.size == 1 ? 'it' : 'them' %>, use <%= @files.size == 1 ? 'it' : 'them' %> in a submission. Nothing
  else is needed: a file a submission uses is kept for as long as the submission holds it.
</p>

<p>If you no longer need <%= @files.size == 1 ? 'this file' : 'these files' %>, you can ignore this message.</p>

<p>Regards,<br>DDBJ Repository</p>
